{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-delta-q-decoration","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:delta-q-decoration","kind":"definition","title":"$q$-dimension decoration $\\delta_q : H_n(q) \\to R^{|\\mathrm{Par}(n)|}$ of the NF basis","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-operator-selection-lp"],"tags":["delta-q","q-dimension","wedderburn-decomposition","hecke-algebra","categorical-trace","force-carrier","infrastructure"],"defines":["delta-q-decoration"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.delta_q","text":"delta-q-decoration.md","leanSource":"delta-q-decoration.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:delta-q-decoration\"></a><p><em>The <dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-delta-q-decoration\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\delta_q</code>-decoration</dfn> maps an algebra element <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b \\in H_n(q)</code> to the tuple of its <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-characters across each irreducible representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_\\lambda</code>:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\delta_q(b)\n  \\;:=\\;\n  \\bigl(\\chi_\\lambda(b)\\bigr)_{\\lambda \\vdash n}\n  \\;\\in\\;\n  R^{|\\,\\mathrm{Par}(n)\\,|}.</code></pre>\n<p><em>Its codomain is the <a href=\"#def:q-dimension-layer\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-dimension layer</a>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-q-decoration.md","heading":"Definition","number":"13.24.6","page":"b/def-delta-q-decoration","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":64},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BraidKnot.del